OL,3,GNEWSADeveloper's school bid rejected by
OL,4,Acouncil
OL,5,
OL,6,FA housing developer that previously
OL,7,Fagreed to provide land for a primary
OL,8,Fschool and pay #4m towards it has had
OL,9,Fan application to scrap the project
OL,10,Fdismissed.
OL,12,FDavid Wilson Homes got planning
OL,13,Fpermission to build up to 401 homes off
OL,14,FOxford Road in Newbury in March 2017.
OL,15,FWest Berkshire Council had rejected the
OL,16,Fscheme in November 2015.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
