OL,3,GNEWSADeveloper's school bid rejected by
OL,4,Acouncil
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe developer asked the council to
OL,7,Fremove the need for the new one-form,
OL,8,F210-pupil school site and its financial
OL,9,Fcontributions for it, arguing that they
OL,10,Fwould only mean more unfilled pupil
OL,11,Fplaces in the area.
OL,13,FBut on Friday the authority rejected
OL,14,Fthat and said the proposals must remain
OL,15,Fpart of the development's "long-term
OL,16,Fplanning framework".
